WEBVTT

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.880 line:0%
[Episode 29]

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:53.680 line:0%
What?

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.589 line:0%
Have you forgotten me so quickly?

00:01:58.089 --> 00:01:59.290 line:0%
Chen Huo'e?

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.120 line:0%
I don't care who you really are, pretending to be her

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.520 line:0%
and playing tricks here.

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:09.430 line:0%
I suggest you,

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:10.800 line:0%
before I take action,

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:12.750 line:0%
give me the antidote first.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:14.720 line:0%
Otherwise, I don't mind

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.600 line:0%
killing Chen Huo'e again.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.879 line:0%
Anyone who has ever

00:02:24.879 --> 00:02:26.140 line:0%
crossed paths with me,

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.200 line:0%
no matter how long ago,

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.210 line:0%
I can still recognize them.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:34.430 line:0%
Chen Huo'e and I have crossed swords several times.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.440 line:0%
So no matter how

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:36.480 line:0%
hard you try to hide

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.140 line:0%
the traces of our encounters,

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.280 line:0%
it's all in vain.

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.570 line:0%
What's fake will always be fake.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:55.720 line:0%
It's just a pity that

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.640 line:0%
there's only one bottle of this antidote.

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:59.260 line:0%
I wonder if you

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.010 line:0%
dare to come and take it.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:20.840 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:21.760 line:0%
you really do care about the people,

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.560 line:0%
even at the risk of your own life.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.440 line:0%
The lives of those lowly commoners,

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.040 line:0%
I have no interest in taking.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.280 line:0%
The antidote is real.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:38.440 line:0%
Of course.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:39.720 line:0%
Your target

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.400 line:0%
has always been me alone.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.640 line:0%
What other tricks do you have?

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:44.970 line:0%
Let's have them all out.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.460 line:0%
The poison on that porcelain vase

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.220 line:0%
will be enough for you to enjoy for quite a while.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.110 line:0%
This poison will travel with your blood,

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.480 line:0%
circulating throughout your body,

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.540 line:0%
spreading the toxin everywhere.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.480 line:0%
Then,

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:14.280 line:0%
your body will become extremely rigid.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:16.520 line:0%
Finally,

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:18.870 line:0%
you will turn into

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.310 line:0%
a breathing tree.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:53.300 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.209 line:0%
you're really persistent.

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.600 line:0%
Why don't you

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.680 line:0%
just quietly

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.240 line:0%
die here?

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.280 line:0%
The supreme leader of the Fire Moth Sect,

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.560 line:0%
your real boss,

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:14.840 line:0%
is someone in the imperial court, isn't it?

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.360 line:0%
You're using Chen Huo'e's identity

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:17.800 line:0%
to deceive people everywhere,

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:21.080 line:0%
constantly changing identities to expand your influence.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.080 line:0%
It's not just about

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.480 line:0%
establishing a Fire Moth Sect in Yingzhou,

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.780 line:0%
but coveting the entire Cang State.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.090 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.370 line:0%
The more you know,

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.530 line:0%
the faster you die.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.900 line:0%
My mission this time is simple:

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.959 line:0%
to eliminate

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:51.930 line:0%
you, Shen Du, and your group in one fell swoop.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:54.610 line:0%
Now,

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.630 line:0%
you're already in my grasp.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:58.560 line:0%
I wonder

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.490 line:0%
who will be next?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.600 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.600 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.170 line:0%
Then I'll choose one myself.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:13.720 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.400 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:29.250 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.680 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:37.800 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.400 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.240 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.630 line:0%
[Pure and Drifting Mist]

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:54.480 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:58.880 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.440 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:14.290 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.130 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:41.320 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.590 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.340 line:0%
I'm afraid the Grand Commander has been poisoned with some strange toxin.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.390 line:0%
Is there an antidote?

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:10.120 line:0%
My medical skills are limited.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.820 line:0%
I can't identify the poison.

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.770 line:0%
You can't identify the poison?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.120 line:0%
The people in the city, after taking the antidote

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:28.160 line:0%
that was brought back by Grand Commander

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.270 line:0%
have improved.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.480 line:0%
But ironically, the Grand Commander himself...

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:32.950 line:0%
This gang of troublemakers

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:33.800 line:0%
keep inventing

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.589 line:0%
inexplicable poisons to harm people.

00:08:35.589 --> 00:08:36.040 line:0%
I must destroy

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:36.880 line:0%
their hideout.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.680 line:0%
Saving his life is the priority.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.080 line:0%
I've already searched in Guangchun Hall

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.080 line:0%
and Mo's Mansion thoroughly,

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:45.680 line:0%
but couldn't find

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:46.720 line:0%
anything related to the poison.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.520 line:0%
I've almost turned over every place

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:48.080 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect has been to,

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:49.400 line:0%
leaving no stone unturned.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.460 line:0%
Chen Huo'e is cunning and deceitful.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.080 line:0%
She wouldn't leave the antidote

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.040 line:0%
in plain sight.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.470 line:0%
Has the Grand Commander recovered?

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.360 line:0%
The acupuncture and meridian sealing

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:42.960 line:0%
is only a temporary measure.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.040 line:0%
I can't think of

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.080 line:0%
any other way

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:49.720 line:0%
to slow down

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.920 line:0%
the rate of his body's rigidification.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.810 line:0%
If we can't find the antidote soon,

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:58.740 line:0%
I'm afraid he...

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:11.080 line:0%
The poison Shen Du has been afflicted with

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:12.810 line:0%
is not from the Central Plains.

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:15.280 line:0%
I've translated books from the Western Regions

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.690 line:0%
and found that the tricks of the Fire Moth Sect

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:17.520 line:0%
are very similar to

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:19.000 line:0%
the legendary secret techniques

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.060 line:0%
of the Jinwu Tribe.

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.920 line:0%
Then let's go seek medical help right away.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:23.720 line:0%
We can't.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.100 line:0%
Many years ago,

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.360 line:0%
the Jinwu Tribe suddenly cut off

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:27.560 line:0%
all contact with the Cang State.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.680 line:0%
They became extremely hostile

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:30.160 line:0%
towards people from the Cang State.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.360 line:0%
If we go there rashly,

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.920 line:0%
not only will we fail to save him,

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:33.800 line:0%
but we might also

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:34.800 line:0%
get ourselves trapped there.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.060 line:0%
Then what should we do?

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.920 line:0%
If I remember correctly,

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:38.760 line:0%
among us,

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.480 line:0%
I'm the one who knows the Western Regions best.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.330 line:0%
I'll go to get the antidote.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.240 line:0%
I'll go too.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.370 line:0%
You need to stay here and keep watch.

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:53.890 line:0%
Shen Du risked his own life

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:56.480 line:0%
to protect the people of Yingzhou.

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.210 line:0%
You should protect him as well,

00:10:58.360 --> 00:10:59.450 line:0%
and more importantly,

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.110 line:0%
take care of Mrs. Shen for him.

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:06.560 line:0%
Fortunately,

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.400 line:0%
we're not far from the Jinwu Tribe.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.440 line:0%
Before I return,

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.080 line:0%
don't do anything.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:16.700 line:0%
Thank you, Mr. Pan.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.120 line:0%
Your great kindness

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.450 line:0%
will be repaid someday.

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.330 line:0%
Be careful on your journey.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:24.580 line:0%
Wait for my return.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.710 line:0%
[Jinwu Tribe]

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:58.760 line:0%
Distinguished customer.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.360 line:0%
I've got something good on me.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.400 line:0%
Take a look.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:08.840 line:0%
Who are you?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.130 line:0%
I told you I have something good

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.530 line:0%
to you to see.

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:18.030 line:0%
People from the Cang State are indeed cunning.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:50.890 line:0%
♫I hope you also look up and see the radiant stars and moon♫

00:12:55.500 --> 00:13:01.110 line:0%
♫No matter how vast the world is, I'll wait for your appearance♫

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.300 line:0%
♫A quick glance at each other♫

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:12.680 line:0%
♫Has warmed the winter in memories♫

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:20.770 line:0%
♫Don't mind the destined solitude, and shine brightly♫

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:27.200 line:0%
♫I'll wait until the years blossom like flowers♫

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:31.930 line:0%
♫The ice and snow slowly melted♫

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.460 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.160 line:0%
I've cooled it down for you.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.790 line:0%
Take a sip.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.420 line:0%
♫I heard those tender words♫

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:42.400 line:0%
♫He told her, "I love you"♫

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:41.960 line:0%
Didn't you tell me last time

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.520 line:0%
that you sprained your shoulder

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:47.380 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.930 line:0%
and couldn't drink by yourself,

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:49.100 line:0%
so you needed me to feed you?

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:52.290 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:51.670 line:0%
Can you sit up and take a sip?

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:53.460 line:0%
Just one sip.

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:58.120 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:01.550 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.630 line:0%
Shen Du, please sit up.

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:28.360 line:0%
Sit up and look at me, Shen Du.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:28.580 line:0%
♫What I saw in my dreams♫

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:30.350 line:0%
I miss you.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:33.380 line:0%
♫Is not a flashy illusion♫

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:39.010 line:0%
♫I don't fear the challenges ahead, riding a white horse to chase after time♫

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.160 line:0%
♫Let's go together♫

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.220 line:0%
I miss you.

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:48.750 line:0%
♫Love is pure and flawless, indifferent to the changes of the world♫

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:52.450 line:0%
♫Let's experience it together♫

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:53.930 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.200 line:0%
Has Madam still

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.860 line:0%
not eaten these past few days?

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.360 line:0%
She has been keeping vigil by the bedside,

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.920 line:0%
administering acupuncture every two hours.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.960 line:0%
She refuses to rest no matter what anyone says,

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.960 line:0%
and won't let anyone else approach.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.700 line:0%
If this continues,

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.760 line:0%
Madam might collapse first.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.760 line:0%
So what do you suggest we do now?

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:20.470 line:0%
By my calculations,

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.270 line:0%
if Mr. Pan's journey goes smoothly,

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:24.530 line:0%
he should be returning from Jinwu by now.

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:27.000 line:0%
I'm afraid that before your Grand Commander's antidote

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:27.600 line:0%
arrives,

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.260 line:0%
Sister might collapse first.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:40.880 line:0%
Madam,

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.520 line:0%
please get some rest.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.460 line:0%
Or at least have something to eat.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.560 line:0%
If the Grand Commander wakes up

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:47.600 line:0%
and finds you've collapsed from exhaustion,

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:48.920 line:0%
he would be devastated.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.360 line:0%
Until he wakes up,

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.720 line:0%
I won't fall.

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.040 line:0%
Mr. Pan is back.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.480 line:0%
I was afraid if I didn't return soon,

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:07.909 line:0%
you wouldn't be able to hold on any longer.

00:17:07.909 --> 00:17:09.310 line:0%
Did you find an antidote?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.850 line:0%
And who is this?

00:17:19.389 --> 00:17:20.200 line:0%
Su Guang.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.450 line:0%
The holy maiden of the Jinwu Tribe.

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.040 line:0%
I told you to

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.640 line:0%
quietly invite him over.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:35.800 line:0%
To invite,

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.320 line:0%
not to carry him here.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.000 line:0%
What happened?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.360 line:0%
He's very cunning.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.820 line:0%
I couldn't get him to come by inviting at all.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:42.640 line:0%
Alright.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:43.520 line:0%
You may leave.

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:27.680 line:0%
You're awake.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:30.850 line:0%
It's you.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:02.920 line:0%
It's the Strangler Vine.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:05.120 line:0%
Holy Maiden, do you know about this poison?

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:05.920 line:0%
The poison

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.840 line:0%
primarily consists of the larvae of the woodworm moth,

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:08.600 line:0%
with toxic plants

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:09.560 line:0%
such as poison arrow wood,

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.400 line:0%
zinnias, and Western aconite

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.660 line:0%
serving as supplementary ingredients.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.280 line:0%
I never thought such a small moth

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.280 line:0%
could produce such a potent poison.

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:21.480 line:0%
But this secret method of poison-making

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:23.520 line:0%
is known only to our tribe's holy maidens,

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.070 line:0%
never shared with outsiders.

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:26.160 line:0%
If it's never shared,

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:27.670 line:0%
then why does the leader of the Fire Moth Sect

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:29.270 line:0%
possess this hidden poison?

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.480 line:0%
Could there be more to this story?

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:37.280 line:0%
I'll cut to the chase.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.280 line:0%
Because this poison is too deadly,

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.800 line:0%
it was banned by our tribe long ago.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.550 line:0%
But many years ago,

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.640 line:0%
one of our holy maidens disappeared

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:46.370 line:0%
and was never heard from again.

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:47.730 line:0%
So you're saying

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:48.960 line:0%
this holy maiden

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.520 line:0%
might have connections with the Fire Moth Sect

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:51.920 line:0%
and passed on the poison?

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:53.440 line:0%
That's impossible.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.120 line:0%
Holy Maiden Daisi

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:56.080 line:0%
would never collude with an evil cult.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.040 line:0%
You're a holy maiden,

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.120 line:0%
so you must have an antidote,

00:19:58.120 --> 00:19:58.880 line:0%
right?

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.120 line:0%
Before coming here,

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.960 line:0%
I heard a brief account from Pan Chi,

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.160 line:0%
and I also consulted some books.

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.280 line:0%
I've specially prepared this medicine.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.810 line:0%
I hope it will be effective.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.760 line:0%
For your kindness today,

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:17.960 line:0%
I'm deeply grateful.

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.040 line:0%
You saved my life,

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.640 line:0%
so I agreed to come with you.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:32.840 line:0%
But this medicine is a separate matter.

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.170 line:0%
Don't forget what you promised me.

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.210 line:0%
A gentleman's word

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:44.300 line:0%
is worth its weight in gold.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.450 line:0%
Mr. Pan is quite something,

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:54.050 line:0%
racking up romantic debts all the way to the Western Regions.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:37.700 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:55.320 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:57.610 line:0%
Shen Du, you're awake.

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:00.790 line:0%
How are you feeling now?

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:03.780 line:0%
Is there anywhere else that feels uncomfortable?

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:06.680 line:0%
Slow down. Slow down.

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:13.850 line:0%
I've been asleep for so long.

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:18.320 line:0%
I've even started to miss you a bit.

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:34.360 line:0%
If you dare to

00:22:34.360 --> 00:22:35.440 line:0%
treat me like this again,

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:37.440 line:0%
I'll never speak to you again.

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:51.750 line:0%
It won't happen again.

00:23:14.890 --> 00:23:16.820 line:0%
The Grand Commander has awakened?

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:18.880 line:0%
You little kid,

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:20.880 line:0%
don't look at things you shouldn't.

00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:22.200 line:0%
Call me a kid again,

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:23.260 line:0%
and I'll get angry.

00:23:23.520 --> 00:23:24.720 line:0%
If you don't think so,

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:25.680 line:0%
let's duel.

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:28.190 line:0%
Kid.

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:29.780 line:0%
Heaven help us, crisis averted.

00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:30.830 line:0%
Heaven help us, crisis averted.

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:32.630 line:0%
Heaven help us, crisis averted.

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:35.590 line:0%
What's wrong with you, kid?

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:36.600 line:0%
Didn't I tell you

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:37.400 line:0%
not to look at things

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:38.920 line:0%
you shouldn't?

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:40.610 line:0%
Why are you so inconsiderate?

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:43.790 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:46.120 line:0%
I really miss you.

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:47.960 line:0%
It seems

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:51.730 line:0%
you've finally put your heart into it.

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:17.960 line:0%
You've been unconscious for days.

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:19.520 line:0%
You shouldn't drink too much tea.

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:20.520 line:0%
Give me your hand.

00:24:39.040 --> 00:24:40.100 line:0%
Your pulse is stable.

00:24:40.100 --> 00:24:42.830 line:0%
It seems the poison has been mostly neutralized.

00:24:47.540 --> 00:24:49.520 line:0%
If you need anything, just say it.

00:24:50.010 --> 00:24:51.000 line:0%
Do you want to eat,

00:24:51.000 --> 00:24:52.860 line:0%
or take a bath and change clothes?

00:25:05.720 --> 00:25:06.520 line:0%
Don't move.

00:25:15.910 --> 00:25:17.440 line:0%
Do you feel any discomfort?

00:25:22.720 --> 00:25:24.000 line:0%
About the situation in Yingzhou,

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:25.760 line:0%
I've asked Jing Lin to keep an eye on it.

00:25:25.760 --> 00:25:26.720 line:0%
Sun Tan is in the city,

00:25:26.720 --> 00:25:28.980 line:0%
maintaining order with the constables.

00:25:30.080 --> 00:25:30.880 line:0%
This matter

00:25:32.440 --> 00:25:33.680 line:0%
will be over soon.

00:25:37.010 --> 00:25:39.540 line:0%
What about the remnants of the Fire Moth Sect?

00:25:39.640 --> 00:25:40.600 line:0%
I've had Jing Lin block

00:25:40.600 --> 00:25:42.280 line:0%
the news that my poison has been cured.

00:25:42.280 --> 00:25:43.880 line:0%
Will they really believe it?

00:25:45.510 --> 00:25:48.310 line:0%
That's exactly what we want - for them to be unsure.

00:26:02.150 --> 00:26:04.220 line:0%
How's the intelligence gathering going?

00:26:04.220 --> 00:26:05.300 line:0%
My Lord,

00:26:06.040 --> 00:26:07.510 line:0%
now there's a rumor spreading in the city.

00:26:07.510 --> 00:26:08.440 line:0%
That official from the capital,

00:26:08.440 --> 00:26:09.640 line:0%
White Ghost is near death.

00:26:09.640 --> 00:26:10.560 line:0%
And his wife,

00:26:10.560 --> 00:26:12.140 line:0%
before her husband has even taken his last breath,

00:26:12.140 --> 00:26:13.730 line:0%
has already gotten involved with that detective Pan Chi.

00:26:13.730 --> 00:26:15.190 line:0%
They're having an affair.

00:26:15.360 --> 00:26:16.480 line:0%
I heard that Shen Du's wife

00:26:16.480 --> 00:26:18.200 line:0%
and Pan Chi were old acquaintances.

00:26:18.200 --> 00:26:19.640 line:0%
Their relationship was already ambiguous.

00:26:19.640 --> 00:26:20.960 line:0%
A wasp's sting is on its tail,

00:26:20.960 --> 00:26:22.360 line:0%
but a woman's heart is the most poisonous of all.

00:26:22.360 --> 00:26:24.200 line:0%
Although the camp was destroyed by the government troops,

00:26:24.200 --> 00:26:25.770 line:0%
as soon as Shen Du dies,

00:26:25.880 --> 00:26:27.420 line:0%
chaos will surely ensue.

00:26:27.450 --> 00:26:29.400 line:0%
At that time, the entire Yingzhou City

00:26:29.400 --> 00:26:31.280 line:0%
will be in your pocket, My Lord.

00:26:36.000 --> 00:26:37.120 line:0%
To prevent any trickery,

00:26:37.120 --> 00:26:37.920 line:0%
investigate further.

00:26:37.920 --> 00:26:38.560 line:0%
Yes.

00:26:50.890 --> 00:26:52.060 line:0%
It's cinnabar.

00:26:53.850 --> 00:26:55.290 line:0%
This fell from Chen Huo'e

00:26:55.690 --> 00:26:57.290 line:0%
during the fight that day.

00:26:57.720 --> 00:26:58.400 line:0%
I had Jing Lin

00:26:58.400 --> 00:27:00.060 line:0%
search Guangchun Hall again.

00:27:00.320 --> 00:27:01.850 line:0%
Sure enough, in the corner,

00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:04.480 line:0%
they found scattered cinnabar that had been left behind.

00:27:04.480 --> 00:27:06.520 line:0%
Cinnabar is often used in alchemy.

00:27:06.520 --> 00:27:07.640 line:0%
It's produced in very small quantities,

00:27:07.640 --> 00:27:08.920 line:0%
so it's extremely valuable.

00:27:08.920 --> 00:27:10.640 line:0%
Ten gold pieces for a dou is not an exaggeration.

00:27:10.640 --> 00:27:12.440 line:0%
How did the Fire Moth Sect get it?

00:27:13.300 --> 00:27:15.960 line:0%
If someone takes small doses over a long period,

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:18.540 line:0%
it can act as a preservative.

00:27:18.960 --> 00:27:19.920 line:0%
So after death,

00:27:19.920 --> 00:27:22.580 line:0%
the body can remain uncorrupted for a long time.

00:27:22.760 --> 00:27:23.670 line:0%
So

00:27:23.720 --> 00:27:24.520 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect had prepared

00:27:24.520 --> 00:27:25.480 line:0%
this technique of resurrection

00:27:25.480 --> 00:27:26.880 line:0%
for their followers long ago.

00:27:26.880 --> 00:27:28.140 line:0%
The mining of cinnabar

00:27:28.240 --> 00:27:30.440 line:0%
is strictly controlled by the imperial court.

00:27:30.440 --> 00:27:31.680 line:0%
Yet the Fire Moth Sect can easily

00:27:31.680 --> 00:27:33.480 line:0%
possess large quantities of it.

00:27:34.960 --> 00:27:36.200 line:0%
It seems they have already infiltrated

00:27:36.200 --> 00:27:37.930 line:0%
Cang State's mining industry.

00:27:38.280 --> 00:27:39.240 line:0%
Their ambitions

00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:41.280 line:0%
are far beyond imagination.

00:27:42.480 --> 00:27:44.260 line:0%
Do you mean...

00:27:48.760 --> 00:27:49.620 line:0%
Could it be that

00:27:50.290 --> 00:27:51.720 line:0%
the person behind this Fire Moth Sect

00:27:51.720 --> 00:27:52.480 line:0%
wants to...

00:28:01.680 --> 00:28:02.480 line:0%
Cry.

00:28:03.880 --> 00:28:04.840 line:0%
Why should I cry?

00:28:11.280 --> 00:28:12.820 line:0%
I can't cry.

00:28:48.780 --> 00:28:50.250 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:29:02.240 --> 00:29:04.500 line:0%
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

00:29:58.840 --> 00:30:00.240 line:0%
Your bewitching incense

00:30:00.320 --> 00:30:01.840 line:0%
should change its tricks.

00:30:29.480 --> 00:30:31.140 line:0%
So you're really still alive.

00:30:31.160 --> 00:30:33.160 line:0%
You really think I'm made of paper?

00:30:54.400 --> 00:30:55.660 line:0%
You're not Chen Huo'e.

00:31:12.760 --> 00:31:13.720 line:0%
Your true face,

00:31:13.720 --> 00:31:15.400 line:0%
is it so unfit to be seen?

00:31:16.970 --> 00:31:18.520 line:0%
Have you really seen through it all,

00:31:18.520 --> 00:31:19.420 line:0%
Shen Du?

00:31:31.080 --> 00:31:32.530 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:31:31.800 --> 00:31:32.590 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:31:33.560 --> 00:31:34.380 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:31:34.380 --> 00:31:35.790 line:0%
She got away.

00:31:38.880 --> 00:31:46.500 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:31:47.050 --> 00:31:48.110 line:0%
Keep an eye on them.

00:31:49.560 --> 00:31:50.680 line:0%
I need them alive.

00:31:53.040 --> 00:31:53.640 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:32:00.700 --> 00:32:05.580 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:32:22.200 --> 00:32:23.160 line:0%
There's actually a method

00:32:23.160 --> 00:32:25.020 line:0%
to make items burn out so quickly.

00:32:26.540 --> 00:32:27.940 line:0%
It happened so suddenly.

00:32:28.120 --> 00:32:29.880 line:0%
There was too much smoke at the time.

00:32:29.880 --> 00:32:30.760 line:0%
I only caught a whiff

00:32:30.760 --> 00:32:31.760 line:0%
of a pungent odor.

00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:39.280 line:0%
What are you thinking about?

00:32:44.520 --> 00:32:45.760 line:0%
Do you remember I mentioned

00:32:45.760 --> 00:32:46.960 line:0%
Holy Maiden Daisi?

00:32:47.600 --> 00:32:48.600 line:0%
According to the legend,

00:32:48.600 --> 00:32:49.760 line:0%
she developed a kind of

00:32:49.760 --> 00:32:50.680 line:0%
combustion-enhancing technique.

00:32:50.680 --> 00:32:52.040 line:0%
Not to mention this wall,

00:32:52.040 --> 00:32:53.480 line:0%
even this entire courtyard

00:32:53.480 --> 00:32:54.560 line:0%
could be burned to ashes

00:32:54.560 --> 00:32:55.820 line:0%
in a matter of moments.

00:33:02.160 --> 00:33:03.160 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:33:03.600 --> 00:33:04.840 line:0%
We've found a witness

00:33:04.840 --> 00:33:06.120 line:0%
to the granary fire from that year.

00:33:06.120 --> 00:33:07.120 line:0%
According to him,

00:33:07.200 --> 00:33:08.160 line:0%
at that time,

00:33:08.160 --> 00:33:08.720 line:0%
there was a

00:33:08.720 --> 00:33:10.080 line:0%
very pungent smell in the area.

00:33:10.080 --> 00:33:11.000 line:0%
Moreover, that fire

00:33:11.000 --> 00:33:12.520 line:0%
looked extremely strange,

00:33:12.520 --> 00:33:14.650 line:0%
occasionally emitting purple light.

00:33:14.920 --> 00:33:17.280 line:0%
The Combustion Technique of the Jinwu Tribe.

00:33:17.280 --> 00:33:19.440 line:0%
If this technique was used to burn the granary,

00:33:19.440 --> 00:33:21.370 line:0%
it indeed wouldn't take half a day.

00:33:22.600 --> 00:33:23.480 line:0%
In that case,

00:33:23.860 --> 00:33:25.540 line:0%
[Fortune and Prosperity]

00:33:24.240 --> 00:33:25.970 line:0%
Holy Maiden Daisi from the Jinwu Tribe

00:33:25.970 --> 00:33:26.960 line:0%
seems to be connected

00:33:26.960 --> 00:33:28.000 line:0%
to the Fire Moth Sect.

00:33:28.000 --> 00:33:28.930 line:0%
What do you mean?

00:33:30.700 --> 00:33:33.760 line:0%
What is Holy Maiden Su Guang's purpose for coming here?

00:33:34.720 --> 00:33:36.160 line:0%
Although our Cang State has little interaction

00:33:36.160 --> 00:33:37.040 line:0%
with the Jinwu Tribe,

00:33:37.040 --> 00:33:38.760 line:0%
we are aware that a missing Holy Maiden

00:33:38.760 --> 00:33:39.890 line:0%
is a major incident.

00:33:40.520 --> 00:33:41.600 line:0%
Such calmness

00:33:42.360 --> 00:33:45.400 line:0%
suggests it might have been premeditated, doesn't it?

00:33:45.400 --> 00:33:47.460 line:0%
I didn't intend to conceal anything.

00:33:47.880 --> 00:33:48.840 line:0%
Holy Maiden Daisi

00:33:48.840 --> 00:33:50.480 line:0%
eloped with a man from Cang State

00:33:50.480 --> 00:33:51.960 line:0%
and has been missing ever since.

00:33:51.660 --> 00:33:55.460 line:0%
[Fortune and Prosperity]

00:33:52.640 --> 00:33:54.800 line:0%
The tribal chief wanted to let the matter rest,

00:33:54.800 --> 00:33:55.920 line:0%
but unexpectedly, in recent years,

00:33:55.920 --> 00:33:57.200 line:0%
there have been multiple occurrences of

00:33:57.200 --> 00:33:58.560 line:0%
illusion techniques and formulas

00:33:58.560 --> 00:34:00.760 line:0%
known only to our tribe's holy maidens.

00:34:00.840 --> 00:34:01.680 line:0%
I thought

00:34:01.680 --> 00:34:03.480 line:0%
we must quickly uncover the truth

00:34:03.480 --> 00:34:07.080 line:0%
to prevent our sacred sect from suffering undeserved calamity.

00:34:08.920 --> 00:34:10.360 line:0%
A man from the Cang State?

00:34:18.600 --> 00:34:19.430 line:0%
[Respectfully report and beg for the Grand Empress Dowager's divine supervision]

00:34:18.920 --> 00:34:19.700 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:34:23.600 --> 00:34:24.600 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:34:24.600 --> 00:34:27.430 line:0%
Send someone to report back to the capital immediately.

00:34:27.430 --> 00:34:29.720 line:0%
The crisis in Yingzhou has been resolved.

00:34:29.720 --> 00:34:30.240 line:0%
Yes.

00:34:36.680 --> 00:34:39.080 line:0%
You've been wandering outside for so long,

00:34:40.990 --> 00:34:42.320 line:0%
finally you're inside.

00:34:54.720 --> 00:34:56.519 line:0%
You're really not being polite.

00:35:05.080 --> 00:35:06.140 line:0%
There's something

00:35:06.200 --> 00:35:07.730 line:0%
I'm not sure if I should say.

00:35:09.280 --> 00:35:10.610 line:0%
If it shouldn't be said,

00:35:10.800 --> 00:35:11.800 line:0%
then don't say it.

00:35:14.560 --> 00:35:16.890 line:0%
I advise you to fulfill your promise soon.

00:35:17.440 --> 00:35:18.800 line:0%
Divorce Yan Xing.

00:35:20.230 --> 00:35:21.720 line:0%
In what capacity are you

00:35:21.720 --> 00:35:22.780 line:0%
speaking to me now?

00:35:23.880 --> 00:35:25.360 line:0%
An old friend

00:35:25.360 --> 00:35:26.760 line:0%
who pretend to be a woman?

00:35:36.840 --> 00:35:38.920 line:0%
You're merely husband and wife in name.

00:35:38.920 --> 00:35:40.360 line:0%
As the esteemed Grand Commander,

00:35:40.360 --> 00:35:42.160 line:0%
you certainly have confidence.

00:35:52.270 --> 00:35:53.160 line:0%
Some words

00:35:56.270 --> 00:35:58.390 line:0%
should be spoken with caution.

00:36:06.910 --> 00:36:09.640 line:0%
As the White Ghost who lives on the edge every day,

00:36:14.280 --> 00:36:16.480 line:0%
how can you bring happiness to Yan Xing?

00:36:16.960 --> 00:36:18.560 line:0%
The safety of my wife

00:36:19.800 --> 00:36:20.760 line:0%
doesn't seem to require

00:36:20.760 --> 00:36:22.020 line:0%
your concern, Mr. Pan.

00:36:25.080 --> 00:36:27.080 line:0%
As long as I, Shen Du, am alive,

00:36:28.480 --> 00:36:30.200 line:0%
no one can harm Yan Xing.

00:36:31.680 --> 00:36:32.400 line:0%
Grand Commander, you're

00:36:32.400 --> 00:36:34.320 line:0%
truly arrogant and domineering.

00:36:34.960 --> 00:36:35.720 line:0%
I really don't know

00:36:35.720 --> 00:36:37.200 line:0%
what Yan Xing sees in you.

00:36:38.120 --> 00:36:38.920 line:0%
Fine,

00:36:39.360 --> 00:36:41.000 line:0%
since you've said it today,

00:36:41.200 --> 00:36:42.920 line:0%
I ask you to keep your word.

00:36:43.280 --> 00:36:44.280 line:0%
Otherwise...

00:36:46.160 --> 00:36:47.200 line:0%
Or else what?

00:36:49.600 --> 00:36:50.560 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:36:51.360 --> 00:36:53.360 line:0%
even if it's to the ends of the earth,

00:36:53.920 --> 00:36:54.960 line:0%
I will definitely come back

00:36:54.960 --> 00:36:55.890 line:0%
to take her away.

00:36:56.120 --> 00:36:57.560 line:0%
The feelings between my wife and me,

00:36:57.560 --> 00:36:58.120 line:0%
you should have already

00:36:58.120 --> 00:36:59.360 line:0%
seen very clearly.

00:36:59.880 --> 00:37:01.720 line:0%
I'll say this here and now,

00:37:04.280 --> 00:37:06.000 line:0%
you won't live to see that day.

00:37:07.880 --> 00:37:08.810 line:0%
That's the best.

00:37:10.560 --> 00:37:12.620 line:0%
Are you leaving with the Holy Maiden?

00:37:15.400 --> 00:37:16.080 line:0%
Aren't you also

00:37:16.080 --> 00:37:17.810 line:0%
interested in the whereabouts

00:37:17.880 --> 00:37:19.340 line:0%
of that Holy Maiden Daisi?

00:37:23.190 --> 00:37:25.120 line:0%
The Holy Maiden's status is noble,

00:37:26.960 --> 00:37:28.690 line:0%
you'd better protect her well.

00:37:34.600 --> 00:37:35.760 line:0%
What a fine cup,

00:37:36.520 --> 00:37:37.780 line:0%
broken just like that.

00:37:41.200 --> 00:37:42.040 line:0%
What a pity.

00:37:43.560 --> 00:37:44.600 line:0%
How reckless.

00:37:58.680 --> 00:38:00.320 line:0%
Thanks to you risking your life

00:38:00.320 --> 00:38:02.780 line:0%
to protect the antidote from the Chen Huo'e.

00:38:03.160 --> 00:38:04.240 line:0%
The poisoned citizens in the city,

00:38:04.240 --> 00:38:05.390 line:0%
after taking it,

00:38:05.560 --> 00:38:06.920 line:0%
quickly recovered.

00:38:07.760 --> 00:38:09.220 line:0%
Seeing the people recover

00:38:09.240 --> 00:38:10.760 line:0%
and live peaceful lives,

00:38:11.440 --> 00:38:12.680 line:0%
I feel that

00:38:13.480 --> 00:38:15.610 line:0%
no matter how hard it is to solve cases,

00:38:15.720 --> 00:38:16.720 line:0%
it's all worth it.

00:38:23.440 --> 00:38:24.240 line:0%
Grand Commander.

